# Ignore Node package files
package.json
package-lock.json
# ...except docman-tool's - without these, a fresh clone has no dependency
# manifest to `npm install` from at all (node_modules/lockfile existed only
# locally, never committed - a real gap this un-ignores rather than papers
# over with a manual install script).
!docman-tool/package.json
!docman-tool/package-lock.json
